rs were only caused by the worker, they should be dropping by now. The API's own v5.1.0 deploy may have a problem too.\n\nI haven't touched `payments-api`. Give it a few minutes, then check it again. If it's still failing, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release, and add that to INC-0001. Just say the word.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01J8bcFgZ3Xq7SMG4xKd4rS5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TdHNgJg4zKDwTPmkW49VYZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01AeJ5gxgEQybM7Fo3HV78jj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01FdF55cAKqSeGd5UWZ4xY2H", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0156Wzka9XRAfUbsGYpb7QY5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011RQvf1pfVtweFcVuosLSsQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-gateway"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NBd3h6WUVZEUNmi8DmM5FN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ho5hgLfU1YSknwQbfYSQG5", "caller": {"type": "dire