ker, they should be dropping by now. The API's own v5.1.0 deploy may have a problem too.\n\nI haven't touched `payments-api`. Give it a few minutes, then check it again. If it's still failing, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release, and add that to INC-0001. Just say the word.", "type": "text"}]}]}